abstract: >-
  The founding treatise of Mitochondrial Cuisine, a culinary discipline that
  organizes the design of food around the mitochondrion as a signaling organelle
  rather than a source of fuel. It is a culinary theory and makes no medical,
  therapeutic, or disease-related claim.